// The long walk through the wildwood: the scene of wildwood.flecs, walked 10 km by the course
// of wildwood/course.flecs from the trail at the start, in seven legs that turn at 1.4, 2.7,
// 4.3, 5.5, 7 and 8.5 km, keeping to the trails it comes upon. It walks at the speed of the
// player (4 m/s) by 1/60 s of the world per frame, 150000 frames, with the frames capped at 120
// FPS: the streaming has a walk's work per frame while the 10 km take 21 to 42 minutes. When the
// walk starts, a perf run measures its frames (p50, p95, p99, worst) and writes them to
// wildwood_walk.json; the course panel shows a row of the streaming every 500 m and what the
// frames over 16.7 ms did.
//
// To start further out, for a look at the far walk, set state.course_seek to the meters to skip
// (the course goes there along the headings of its legs and waits for the ground).
include wildwood
include wildwood/course

using box.perf

// The keys the perf run holds (forward and left) reach no controller: the course moves the
// player itself
$ {
  if state.course_started {
    box.perf.Run: {
      fps: 120,
      frames: 149800,
      warmup: 120,
      period: 0,
      camera: player,
      fly: true,
      report: "wildwood_walk.json"
    }
  }
}
